'''Leaf Cape''' (Japanese: '''リーフマント''' ''Leaf Cloak'') is a {{TCGP|Pokémon Tool}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Celestial Guardians}} expansion.

